    {
      "source": "Return the native request of the underlying server API, if possible,\nalso unwrapping <a href=\"ServerHttpRequestDecorator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.http.server.reactive\"><code>ServerHttpRequestDecorator</code></a> if necessary.",
      "translation": "返回底层服务器 API 的原生请求（如果可能），并在必要时解包 `<a href=\"ServerHttpRequestDecorator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.http.server.reactive\"><code>ServerHttpRequestDecorator</code></a>`。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Wraps another <a href=\"ServerHttpRequest.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.server.reactive\"><code>ServerHttpRequest</code></a> and delegates all methods to it.\nSubclasses can override specific methods selectively.",
      "translation": "封装另一个 `<a href=\"ServerHttpRequest.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.http.server.reactive\"><code>ServerHttpRequest</code></a>` 并将其所有方法委托给它。子类可以有选择地重写特定方法。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the body of the message as a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.3-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Publisher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>Publisher</code></a>.",
      "translation": "将消息正文返回为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.reactive-streams.org/reactive-streams-1.0.3-javadoc/org/reactivestreams/Publisher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.reactivestreams\"><code>Publisher</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a mutable map of request attributes for this request.",
      "translation": "返回此请求的请求属性可变映射。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a read-only map of cookies sent by the client.",
      "translation": "返回由客户端发送的 Cookie 的只读映射。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the headers of this message.",
      "translation": "返回此消息的标题。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return an id that represents the underlying connection, if available,\nor the request for the purpose of correlating log messages.",
      "translation": "返回一个标识底层连接的 ID（如果可用），或者用于关联日志消息的请求。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the local address the request was accepted on, if available.",
      "translation": "如有可用，返回请求被接受的本地地址。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the HTTP method of the request.",
      "translation": "返回请求的 HTTP 方法。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a read-only map with parsed and decoded query parameter values.",
      "translation": "返回一个包含解析和解码后的查询参数值的只读映射。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the remote address where this request is connected to, if available.",
      "translation": "如果可用，返回此请求连接的远程地址。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the SSL session information if the request has been transmitted\nover a secure protocol including SSL certificates, if available.",
      "translation": "如果请求已通过包括 SSL 证书在内的安全协议传输，则返回可用的 SSL 会话信息。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the URI of the request (including a query string if any,\nbut only if it is well-formed for a URI representation).",
      "translation": "返回请求的 URI（包括任何查询字符串，但仅当其符合 URI 表示格式时）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
