    {
      "source": "<code>request</code> - the request to check",
      "translation": "<code>request</code> - 要检查的请求",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The returned path is subdivided into a\n<a href=\"../RequestPath.html#contextPath()\"><code>RequestPath.contextPath()</code></a> portion and the remaining\n<a href=\"../RequestPath.html#pathWithinApplication()\"><code>pathWithinApplication</code></a> portion.\nThe latter can be passed into methods of\n<a href=\"../../../web/util/pattern/PathPattern.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.util.pattern\"><code>PathPattern</code></a> for path\nmatching purposes.",
      "translation": "返回的路径被细分为 `<a href=\"../RequestPath.html#contextPath()\"><code>RequestPath.contextPath()</code></a>` 部分和剩余的 `<a href=\"../RequestPath.html#pathWithinApplication()\"><code>pathWithinApplication</code></a>` 部分。后者可以传递给 `<a href=\"../../../web/util/pattern/PathPattern.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.util.pattern\"><code>PathPattern</code></a>` 类的方法，用于路径匹配目的。",
      "count": 1
    },
